==Russian==

===Etymology===
Perhaps from {{der|ru|de|manipulieren}} + {{af|ru|-овать}}; see also {{af|ru|-и́ровать}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{ru-IPA|манипули́ровать}}

===Verb===
{{ru-verb|манипули́ровать|impf}}

# to [[manipulate]], to [[control]], to [[handle]], to [[operate]] {{+obj|ru|ins<a machine, tool, etc.>}}
# {{lb|ru|figurative|psychology}} to [[manipulate]], to [[control]] [[psychologically]] {{+obj|ru|ins<a person, someone's will, etc.>}}

====Conjugation====
{{ru-conj|impf-intr|2a|манипули́ровать}}

====Related terms====
* {{l|ru|манипуля́ция}}
* {{l|ru|манипуля́тор}}

====Descendants====
* {{desc|hy|մանիպուլացնել|der=on|bor=on}}
